  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R1.00 corner relief (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 2.00u vertical (1u wide x 2u tall, courtyard 19.00x38.05mm). Cherry MX PCB-mount stabilizer holes included (vertical 2u, wire side at x=-8.255). Stabilizer plate cut on User.5 (fits plate-mount and PCB-mount MX stabilizers).")
